; Lili, sketch A "Teddy March": E minor, 116 bpm. A toy-soldier march: the flute chirps a chromatic hook (D# against E minor) over an oom-pah bass and a snare-roll kit, a low clarinet fills the gaps. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
